{"id":"n71808-1-10","stage":3,"title":"창고 · 仓库","scene":"居住与环境","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n71808-1-10-1","ko":"선풍기 못 찾았어?","zh":"没找到风扇吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"선풍기","meaning":"电扇，电风扇","explanation":"선풍기：电扇，电风扇","readings":[{"term":"선풍기","audio":"/audio/0d0fc3fd9a43d2e175ff.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"44917","senseId":"1","lemma":"선풍기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"못","meaning":"不会做动词所指的动作。","explanation":"못：不会做动词所指的动作。","readings":[{"term":"못","audio":"/audio/89058d16546c11076dd1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17254","senseId":"1","lemma":"못","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"찾았어?","meaning":"寻，觅，访，寻找，查","explanation":"찾다：寻，觅，访，寻找，查；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"찾다","audio":"/audio/0aa19509314fd87953eb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57320","senseId":"1","lemma":"찾다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"0d0fc3fd9a43d2e1","term":"선풍기","zh":"电扇，电风扇","audio":"/audio/0d0fc3fd9a43d2e175ff.mp3","entryId":"44917","definition":"利用电力产生风以驱赶热气的机器。","pronunciation":["선풍기"]},{"id":"89058d16546c1107","term":"못","zh":"不会做动词所指的动作。","audio":"/audio/89058d16546c11076dd1.mp3","entryId":"17254","definition":"不会做动词所指的动作。","pronunciation":["몯ː"]},{"id":"0aa19509314fd879","term":"찾다","zh":"寻，觅，访，寻找，查","audio":"/audio/0aa19509314fd87953eb.mp3","entryId":"57320","definition":"为了得到某物或为了见某人而四处查找；或指得到此物或见此人。","pronunciation":["찯따"]}],"audio":"/audio/ffcf33477acc5c98c99d.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n71808-1-10-2","ko":"작년 여름에 쓰고 분명히 창고에 넣어 두었는데 어디 갔는지 안 보이네.","zh":"去年夏天用过之后明明放进了仓库，可现在怎么也找不到了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"작년","meaning":"去年","explanation":"작년：去年","readings":[{"term":"작년","audio":"/audio/201b780a33a41d77aa74.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30184","senseId":"1","lemma":"작년","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"여름에","meaning":"夏，夏天，夏季","explanation":"여름：夏，夏天，夏季；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"여름","audio":"/audio/4442e49ca3d7c1ba77c7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67701","senseId":"1","lemma":"여름","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"쓰고","meaning":"用，使用","explanation":"쓰다：用，使用；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"쓰다","audio":"/audio/e5721a077be2e027ff8c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71285","senseId":"1","lemma":"쓰다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"분명히","meaning":"肯定地，分明地，明明白白地","explanation":"분명히：肯定地，分明地，明明白白地","readings":[{"term":"분명히","audio":"/audio/5886d7564ad76ada0d96.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71047","senseId":"3","lemma":"분명히","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"창고에","meaning":"仓库，库房","explanation":"창고：仓库，库房；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"창고","audio":"/audio/5f4ebee4ce9930e7c79f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71808","senseId":"1","lemma":"창고","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"넣어","meaning":"放进，装进","explanation":"넣다：放进，装进；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"넣다","audio":"/audio/c0bd6058bd724000a75e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64509","senseId":"1","lemma":"넣다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"두었는데","meaning":"表示前面动作结果的持续进行。","explanation":"두다：表示前面动作结果的持续进行。；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；는데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。","readings":[{"term":"두다","audio":"/audio/531b2c3977c491e8379e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"48279","senseId":"1","lemma":"두다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"어디","meaning":"哪里，哪儿","explanation":"어디：哪里，哪儿","readings":[{"term":"어디","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60319","senseId":"1","lemma":"어디","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"갔는지","meaning":"去","explanation":"가다：去；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；는지：引入未确定的信息、间接疑问或选择：“是否、怎么、何时”等。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"17","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"안","meaning":"不","explanation":"안：不","readings":[{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71372","senseId":"1","lemma":"안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"보이네.","meaning":"显露，露出","explanation":"보이다：显露，露出；네：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"보이다","audio":"/audio/da6f27438e6f345c1e87.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62091","senseId":"2","lemma":"보이다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"201b780a33a41d77","term":"작년","zh":"去年","audio":"/audio/201b780a33a41d77aa74.mp3","entryId":"30184","definition":"正经历的年份的前面一年。","pronunciation":["장년"]},{"id":"4442e49ca3d7c1ba","term":"여름","zh":"夏，夏天，夏季","audio":"/audio/4442e49ca3d7c1ba77c7.mp3","entryId":"67701","definition":"四季之一，介于春秋之间的季节。","pronunciation":["여름"]},{"id":"e5721a077be2e027","term":"쓰다","zh":"用，使用","audio":"/audio/e5721a077be2e027ff8c.mp3","entryId":"71285","definition":"做某事时利用材料、工具等。","pronunciation":["쓰다"]},{"id":"5886d7564ad76ada","term":"분명히","zh":"肯定地，分明地，明明白白地","audio":"/audio/5886d7564ad76ada0d96.mp3","entryId":"71047","definition":"事实准确无误地。","pronunciation":["분명히"]},{"id":"5f4ebee4ce9930e7","term":"창고","zh":"仓库，库房","audio":"/audio/5f4ebee4ce9930e7c79f.mp3","entryId":"71808","definition":"聚集或放置各种东西的地方。","pronunciation":["창고"]},{"id":"c0bd6058bd724000","term":"넣다","zh":"放进，装进","audio":"/audio/c0bd6058bd724000a75e.mp3","entryId":"64509","definition":"使进入某个空间里。","pronunciation":["너ː타"]},{"id":"531b2c3977c491e8","term":"두다","zh":"表示前面动作结果的持续进行。","audio":"/audio/531b2c3977c491e8379e.mp3","entryId":"48279","definition":"表示前面动作结果的持续进行。","pronunciation":["두다"]},{"id":"c1ee1b7e560f9f3a","term":"어디","zh":"哪里，哪儿","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3","entryId":"60319","definition":"指代不知道的处所。","pronunciation":["어디"]},{"id":"233cb510410b09d6","term":"가다","zh":"去","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3","entryId":"27500","definition":"消失不见。","pronunciation":["가다"]},{"id":"bc00bc8172c83d5f","term":"안","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3","entryId":"71372","definition":"表示否定或反对。","pronunciation":["안"]},{"id":"da6f27438e6f345c","term":"보이다","zh":"显露，露出","audio":"/audio/da6f27438e6f345c1e87.mp3","entryId":"62091","definition":"观察对象而了解其内容或状态。","pronunciation":["보이다"]}],"audio":"/audio/65f17baa33a793771977.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.037,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=71808","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":99,"sequenceScore":2.6346,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["没找到风扇吗？","去年夏天用过之后明明放进了仓库，可现在怎么也找不到了。","最近您在做什么工作呢？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["没找到风扇吗？","去年夏天用过之后明明放进了仓库，可现在怎么也找不到了。","最近您在做什么工作呢？"],"answer":1}]}
